docs {
  # WellbeingService.GetDiscipline

  Discipline: staff report faults; serious measures, suspensions, conditional enrollment and expulsion are the director's; families may ask for reconsideration within three school days

  `/ltedu.wellbeing.v1.WellbeingService/GetDiscipline` · unary · `ltedu/wellbeing/v1/wellbeing.proto`

